bitfield.description:
Controls starting of timers and continuous or single shot modes;
                           bit 3 = timer stop strobe. self-clearing.  If timer running. setting bit stops the timer.  A subsequent start will start the timer from load value;
                           bit 2 = pause timer if set.  Timer will stop counting down until cleared.;
                           bit 1 = indicates continuous timer if set. single event if cleared;
                           bit 0 = timer start. self-clearing;If  stopped. setting bit 0 starts the timer.  If running. setting bit 0 is ignores.
                           bit 4 = when set, counter counts on clock freq (40MHz). when cleared, couter counts at usec frequency

